messages.text:
Kat: Come on!{be01}
Phae: Look! Even though we lost,
the ball is still spinning!

When you are watching basketball,
it reminds you of fruit in a basket,{be00}
and it looks delicious. Right?

My special skill is that I can
spin a ball on my finger.{be00}
I can spin it forever!{be01}

I want to have Poké Balls
with the same designs as{be00}
the balls used in sports!
